sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    box PUBLIC ZONE
        participant RS as Routing Service<br>trade-imports-<br>routing-proxy
        participant JF as Journey Frontend<br>trade-imports-<br>{journey}-frontend
    end
    box PROTECTED ZONE
        participant SS as Session Service
        participant JB as Journey Backend<br>trade-imports-<br>{journey}-backend
        participant PS as Permissions Service
    end
    box AWS PLATFORM
        participant STS as AWS STS
    end

    B->>RS: GET /gbn-ag/notifications/123<br>session cookie
    RS->>JF: GET /notifications/123<br>X-Forwarded-Prefix: /gbn-ag,<br>session cookie
    Note over JF: Sealed cookie value read<br>from the cookie
    JF->>STS: GetWebIdentityToken
    STS-->>JF: Service token
    JF->>SS: GET /sessions/assertion<br>Authorization: service token,<br>Ins-Session-Token, Sec-Fetch-*,<br>Ins-Browser-Accept
    Note over SS: Value unsealed, record loaded,<br>limits and confirmation checked
    Note over SS: lastSeenAt written,<br>no refresh
    SS-->>JF: 200 session assertion,<br>csrfSecret, displayName,<br>organisation, role names
    JF->>JB: GET /notifications/123<br>Authorization: service token,<br>Ins-Session-Assertion
    Note over JB: Assertion signature,<br>audience and expiry checked
    JB->>PS: POST /permissions/expansions<br>roles
    PS-->>JB: 200 permissions
    Note over JB: Query scoped to<br>Northgate Produce Ltd
    JB-->>JF: 200 notification 123
    Note over JF: Page rendered
    JF-->>RS: 200 page
    RS-->>B: 200 page
